            </div>
            <div class="text-center mb-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">22 kW Wallbox</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Für schnelles Laden</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center mb-6">
              <span class="text-4xl font-bold">ab 1.890€</span>
